  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_12
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers 8 Free Games. \n- Scatter is removed
      in Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_2
    value: '<size=24>- Wild appears on reels 3, 4, and 5 in Base Game.

      - In Free Games, it appears on reel 3 only and expands.

      - Expanded Wild remains locked for 3 spins and offers multiplier.

      - Multiplier increases incrementally from 2x, 4x, to 8x.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_1
    value: "<size=24>- Locked Wild appears in Free Games only on reels 2 and 4 and\n
      \ remains locked until Free Game ends."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
